{"4286910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EON Survivor", "steam_appid": 4286910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4970710], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/b4930d6bec566132aa4693182e17004b.poster.avif?t=1787703323\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/b4930d6bec566132aa4693182e17004b.webm?t=1787703323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/b4930d6bec566132aa4693182e17004b.mp4?t=1787703323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humanity's survival depends on resources found only in the most dangerous regions of space.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy into hostile alien territory, harvest valuable resources, complete high-risk missions, and survive relentless enemy swarms. Every expedition is a fight against overwhelming odds, where every decision shapes your build and every upgrade brings you one step closer to becoming an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dozens of unique weapons, powerful upgrades, and permanent ship progression, no two runs are ever the same. Experiment with countless build combinations, adapt to unpredictable threats, and push deeper into enemy-controlled space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/aa1e6729f3656bda2711dc7c720d0750.poster.avif?t=1787703323\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/aa1e6729f3656bda2711dc7c720d0750.webm?t=1787703323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/aa1e6729f3656bda2711dc7c720d0750.mp4?t=1787703323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through massive waves of alien enemies in fast-paced, action-packed combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a wide variety of dynamic secondary missions with unique objectives and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest valuable resources to strengthen your ship and unlock permanent progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful weapons, upgrades, and synergies to create devastating builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique sectors, each featuring distinct hazards, environmental effects, and enemy encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade multiple ships, each with its own strengths and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face elite enemies, dangerous events, and escalating challenges that keep every expedition unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through handcrafted sectors designed for high replayability and endless experimentation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/7d18889b2a0b179310c020a001ad85e0.poster.avif?t=1787703323\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/7d18889b2a0b179310c020a001ad85e0.webm?t=1787703323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/7d18889b2a0b179310c020a001ad85e0.mp4?t=1787703323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a new opportunity to take greater risks, build stronger ships, and uncover what lies deeper within alien territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How far are you willing to go for humanity's survival?</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/b4930d6bec566132aa4693182e17004b.poster.avif?t=1787703323\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/b4930d6bec566132aa4693182e17004b.webm?t=1787703323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286910/extras/b4930d6bec566132aa4693182e17004b.mp4?t=1787703323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humanity's survival depends on resources found only in the most dangerous regions of space.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy into hostile alien territory, harvest valuable resources, complete high-risk missions, and survive relentless enemy swarms. Every expedition is a fight against overwhelming odds, where every decision shapes your build and every upgrade brings you one step closer to becoming an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dozens of unique weapons, powerful upgrades, and permanent ship progression, no two runs are ever the same. Experiment with countless build combinations, adapt to unpredictable threats, and push deeper into enemy-controlled space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p c